# Emrakul, the Promised End is countered on turn 7: its trigger is on the stack above the spell and was put there by casting it, so it still resolves
# (the ruling: it resolves even if that spell is countered). Bot2's Counterspell (two Islands) counters the spell; Emrakul goes to the graveyard, yet Bot2 is
# controlled by Bot1 on turn 8 and takes an extra turn 9, then Bot1 plays turn 10.

